      "id": "claim_0e1c19a964154687867cb3f066e87e66",
      "statement": "The recommended one-time verification that both registrations are wired correctly is to temporarily remove the action's init() registration (expect an async 'unknown action' failure) and then temporarily remove the catalog entry (expect 404), restoring both afterward.",
